{"i":692,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":4,"phase":"play","name":"Hana","text":"I'm out and safe. Gus anchored for me last round; we have a pact. I should stay out and not risk breaking anything. Ash and Gus are still down with the rope used. No need to act now."}
